### Users API Documentation
### Complete API documentation for user management endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@employeeToken = your-employee-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### GET ALL USERS
### ============================================
### Get all users with pagination and optional filters (public access)
### No authentication required
### Supports filtering by specification, mode, verification status, and search

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10&search=John&sortBy=name&sortOrder=asc&mode=freelancer&isVerifiedAsFreelancer=true&specification=uuid-here
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Query Parameters:
### - page: Page number (default: 1, min: 1)
### - limit: Items per page (default: 10, min: 1, max: 100)
### - search: Search by name (optional)
### - sortBy: Sort field - "name", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "avgRating" (default: "createdAt")
### - sortOrder: Sort direction - "asc" or "desc" (default: "desc")
### - isVerified: Filter by general verification status (optional, boolean)
### - specification: Filter by specification ID (optional, UUID)
### - isVerifiedAsFreelancer: Filter by freelancer verification (optional, boolean)
### - isVerifiedAsClient: Filter by client verification (optional, boolean)
### - mode: Filter by mode - "freelancer" or "client" (optional)

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Users fetched successfully",
###   "data": [
###     {
###       "id": "user-uuid",
###       "name": "John Doe",
###       "phone": "+1234567890",
###       "phoneVerification": true,
###       "country": "US",
###       "address": "123 Main St",
###       "overview": "Experienced developer",
###       "jobTitle": "Senior Developer",
###       "mode": "freelancer",
###       "isVerifiedAsFreelancer": true,
###       "isVerifiedAsClient": false,
###       "isSuspended": false,
###       "suspendedReason": null,
###       "available": true,
###       "avgRating": 4.5,
###       "totalReviews": 10,
###       "faceIdenbility": true,
###       "specificationId": "spec-uuid",
###       "profilePicture": "file-uuid",
###       "profilePictureData": {
###         "id": "file-uuid",
###         "url": "https://example.com/profile.jpg",
###         "fileName": "profile.jpg",
###         "fileType": "image",
###         "filePurpose": "profile",
###         "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
###         "fileSize": 102400,
###         "status": "ready",
###         "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###         "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###       },
###       "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2"],
###       "tags": ["tag-uuid-1"],
###       "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###       "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###     }
###   ],
###   "pagination": {
###     "total": 100,
###     "page": 1,
###     "limit": 10
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### GET USER BY ID
### ============================================
### Get a specific user by their ID (public access)
### No authentication required
### Returns user with related data (specification, skills, tags, reviews, portfolio)

GET {{baseUrl}}/users/:id
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Replace :id with actual user UUID
### Example: GET {{baseUrl}}/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "User fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "user-uuid",
###     "name": "John Doe",
###     "phone": "+1234567890",
###     "phoneVerification": true,
###     "country": "US",
###     "address": "123 Main St",
###     "overview": "Experienced developer with 5+ years",
###     "jobTitle": "Senior Developer",
###     "mode": "freelancer",
###     "isVerifiedAsFreelancer": true,
###     "isVerifiedAsClient": false,
###     "isSuspended": false,
###     "suspendedReason": null,
###     "available": true,
###     "avgRating": 4.5,
###     "totalReviews": 10,
###     "faceIdenbility": true,
###     "specificationId": "spec-uuid",
###     "profilePicture": "file-uuid",
###     "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2"],
###     "tags": ["tag-uuid-1"],
###     "specification": {
###       "id": "spec-uuid",
###       "name": "Web Development",
###       "icon": "web-icon.svg"
###     },
###     "skillsData": [
###       {
###         "id": "skill-uuid-1",
###         "name": "JavaScript",
###         "specificationId": "spec-uuid"
###       }
###     ],
###     "tagsData": [
###       {
###         "id": "tag-uuid-1",
###         "name": "Frontend",
###         "badgeUrl": "frontend-badge.svg"
###       }
###     ],
###     "reviews": [],
###     "portfolio": null,
###     "previousWork": [],
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### Error Response (User Not Found):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "User not found"
### }

### Error Response (Invalid ID):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Validation error",
###   "errors": [
###     {
###       "field": "id",
###       "message": "id must be a valid UUID"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### ============================================
