### ============================================
### UPDATE MY PROFILE
### ============================================
### Update the authenticated user's profile (requires authentication)
### At least one field must be provided
### Skills and tags can be provided as arrays or comma-separated strings
### Profile picture requires file upload via /api/s3/upload-url first

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "overview": "Updated overview with more details",
  "jobTitle": "Lead Developer",
  "country": "CA",
  "address": "456 New St",
  "specificationId": "new-spec-uuid",
  "profilePicture": "new-file-uuid",
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2", "skill-uuid-3"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1", "tag-uuid-2"],
  "available": true
}

### Update Only Name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated"
}

### Update Profile Picture
### Step 1: Upload file using /api/s3/upload-url with filePurpose: "profile"
### Step 2: Use the returned fileId as profilePicture value
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "profilePicture": "file-uuid-from-s3-upload-response"
}

### Update Skills and Tags (Array Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2", "skill-uuid-3"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1", "tag-uuid-2"]
}

### Update Skills and Tags (Comma-Separated Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "skills": "skill-uuid-1,skill-uuid-2,skill-uuid-3",
  "tags": "tag-uuid-1,tag-uuid-2"
}

### Update Multiple Fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "overview": "Updated overview with more details",
  "jobTitle": "Lead Developer",
  "country": "CA",
  "address": "456 New St",
  "specificationId": "new-spec-uuid",
  "profilePicture": "new-file-uuid",
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1"],
  "available": true
}

### Response Example:
### {
