### ============================================
### SWITCH MODE
### ============================================
### Switch user mode between freelancer and client (requires authentication)
### User can switch between "freelancer" and "client" modes

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/mode
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "mode": "client"
}

### Valid mode values: "freelancer" or "client"

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Mode switched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "user-uuid",
###     "name": "John Doe",
###     "mode": "client",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### Error Response (Invalid Mode):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Validation error",
###   "errors": [
###     {
###       "field": "mode",
###       "message": "Mode must be either 'freelancer' or 'client'"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### ============================================
### VERIFY USER AS FREELANCER
### ============================================
### Verify a user as a freelancer (employee only)
### Sets isVerifiedAsFreelancer to true

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/:id/verify/freelancer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Replace :id with actual user UUID

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "User verified as freelancer successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "user-uuid",
###     "name": "John Doe",
###     "isVerifiedAsFreelancer": true,
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### Error Response (User Not Found):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "User not found"
### }

### ============================================
### VERIFY USER AS CLIENT
### ============================================
### Verify a user as a client (employee only)
### Sets isVerifiedAsClient to true

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/:id/verify/client
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Replace :id with actual user UUID

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "User verified as client successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "user-uuid",
###     "name": "John Doe",
###     "isVerifiedAsClient": true,
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

